  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agro value chains and circular packaging Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands is aiming to focus and assess its interventions in Kenya, in order to do less, but to do it better and more flexible.Therefore, there has been decided to work through a systems approach and to only intervene in those areas where there is a strong local need and where the Netherlands has specific expertise to bring. The chosen system is circular packaging in agro-food and flower value chains in relation to more economic activities and job creation. Through this project, actors in the system will help to co-create the approach that the Netherlands can take, to develop specific interventions that will lead to real impact.</narrative>
  </description>
